{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_1","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc 'cat data/accounting-master/deliverables/P04/progress.md && wc -l scripts/reconstruction_v1.py scripts/rational_solver_v1.py tests/test_accounting_p04.py docs/design/spec/reconstruction-profile-v1.md'","aggregated_output":"# P04 implementation checkpoint\n\nRecovery verified: P04 deliverables, tests and implementation modules were absent.\nThe complete accepted plan and review are the current contract. Z3 4.16.0 and\nPython 3.11.15 are installed. All 384 files in the supervisor phase-entry inventory\nmatch their recorded hashes; that supplied pre-edit inventory is the execution\nbaseline for this first implementation attempt. No GPU or external model is used.\n\nSkeptical audit passed after checking the reviewed repair against P03: named\nalternatives with choice_group=null are conditional predicates, not exhaustive\nchoices. Parent and conditional queries must remain separate. Exact enumeration\nof original inputs and algebra are the comparators; solver success and test counts\ncannot establish accounting validity. Resource exhaustion and unresolved obligations\nprevent exact certification; failed checks trigger local repair.\n\nCurrent changes: this progress checkpoint only.\nNext: add versioned reconstruction profile, fixtures, rational solver,\nreconstruction/adapter, tests and checker. Run P04 tests, P03 regression and the\nP04 checker against the supplied inventory. Both required deliverables remain\nunfinished. Broader MC01–MC35/G1–G18 and human acceptance remain open.\n  269 scripts/reconstruction_v1.py\n  412 scripts/rational_solver_v1.py\n  147 tests/test_accounting_p04.py\n  107 docs/design/spec/reconstruction-profile-v1.md\n  935 total\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
