e\natom weights are counted once. Completeness of this external modeling assumption\nis not inferred from normalization. Admission checks validate category fields,\nprovenance, dependencies and declared treatment membership. They do not establish\nthe external truth of evidence, package eligibility or statistical identification.\n\nGrouping supports nonnegative, unhedged, fixed/floating bullet debt only. Principal\nis unchanged within the declared horizon and no maturity occurs there; interest\nis principal times the common rate times the declared year fraction. Summation\npreserves both expressions by distributivity. Additional contract fields,\nhedges, amortization and more general transitions are unsupported. Matching memory\nkeys and request hashes enforce revalidation after relevant changes.\nEOF\nCUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python3 -B -m unittest discover -s tests -p '\"'test_accounting_p04.py' -v > /tmp/accdsl-p04-final-check.txt 2>&1\n tail -n 5 /tmp/accdsl-p04-final-check.txt\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
